{"data":{"attachmentkeynames":["rs"],"desc":"Bounded autonomous model/tool loop with existing tool budget, duplicate/failure aborts, verify nudge, and whole-goal completion gate. Plan runs emit live safe activity and structured v2 checkpoints at provider delivery, assistant progress milestones, tool observations, verification-pending boundaries, and finish/interruption. Milestone checkpoints keep the run active; finish preserves interrupted vs normal state. A process-start identity supplements boot/PID for honest restart detection. Prompt-only public signature is unchanged; raw tool arguments/provider transcripts are not persisted; internal activity writer is not a model tool. COMPLETION GATE FEEDBACK (2026-11-12): the gate reads up to 24000 chars of the DONE report (was 2500) and is asked for up to five lines of reasons after PARTIAL. A refused DONE returns status IN_PROGRESS plus gate_reason, and on plan runs the checkpoint's NEXT becomes 'COMPLETION GATE REFUSED DONE ...' with those reasons. A second refusal in a row (the inherited checkpoint's NEXT carries that marker) on a turn whose tool calls were all reads returns status BLOCKED, with the reasons in msg and in the checkpoint's NEXT and blockers, so step_item moves the item to the blocked lifecycle. The gate still judges against the GOAL line only (not the item's DETAIL or notes).","import":"use flowlang::command::Command;\nuse flowlang::datastore::DataStore;\nuse crate::agent::llm::chat_llm::chat_llm;\nuse ndata::dataarray::DataArray;\n","params":[{"name":"prompt","type":"String"}],"returntype":"FLAT","type":"rust"},"id":"lnmvtl19edbeb72a7tc3a","readers":[],"time":1794483440101,"username":"system","writers":[]}